{"name":"Xoxo","hex":"#f08497","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"xoxo","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Abbreviation of hugs and kisses, usually placed at the end of a letter."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/xoxo"}],"entries":[{"title":"XOXO (Exo album)","blocks":[{"text":"XOXO is the debut studio album by South Korean boy band Exo, released on June 3, 2013, by SM Entertainment and distributed by KT Music. The album is a follow-up to the group's debut EP, Mama (2012). The album was released in two versions – a Korean \"Kiss\" edition and a Chinese \"Hug\" edition."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/0b/EXO-XOXO-First_Album.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XOXO_(Exo_album)"},{"title":"XOXO (festival)","blocks":[{"text":"XOXO was an annual festival and conference held in Portland, Oregon, that described itself as \"an experimental festival for independent artists who live and work online\". XOXO was founded in 2012 by Andy Baio and Andy McMillan with funding from prepaid tickets and other contributions via Kickstarter. In 2016, technology website The Verge called it \"the internet's best festival\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Chad_Dickerson_at_XOXO_Festival.jpg/330px-Chad_Dickerson_at_XOXO_Festival.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XOXO_(festival)"},{"title":"Hugs and kisses","blocks":[{"text":"Hugs and kisses, abbreviated in the Anglosphere as XO or XOXO, is an informal term used for expressing sincerity, faith, love, or good friendship at the end of a written letter, email or text message."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hugs_and_kisses"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/bd/EXO_Growl_album_cover.jpg/250px-EXO_Growl_album_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/bd/EXO_Growl_album_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/bd/EXO_Growl_album_cover.jpg/250px-EXO_Growl_album_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AEXO_Growl_album_cover.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/XOXO_Festival_2014.jpg/500px-XOXO_Festival_2014.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/XOXO_Festival_2014.jpg/1280px-XOXO_Festival_2014.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/XOXO_Festival_2014.jpg/500px-XOXO_Festival_2014.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"XOXO 2014 inside The Redd","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AXOXO_Festival_2014.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/XOXO_2024_entrance.jpg/500px-XOXO_2024_entrance.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/XOXO_2024_entrance.jpg/1280px-XOXO_2024_entrance.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/XOXO_2024_entrance.jpg/500px-XOXO_2024_entrance.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Entrance to the 2024 XOXO festival","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AXOXO_2024_entrance.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}